{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《玄戰》的新晉主持甄敏芳（Jenny），憑著甜美的外貌與亮眼的表現，成功收穫大批觀眾喜愛。最近，她於節目中以一襲斜膊貼身白裙造型驚艷登場，隨即引發網絡熱烈討論，更獲網民洗版式狂讚，形容她猶如「雅典娜女神」化身！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b019f2f7-afb0-4aae-a45b-2f4c2485be34.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wPimhJHwbw1788945011.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b019f2f7-afb0-4aae-a45b-2f4c2485be34.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從曝光的照片中可見，Jenny站在迷人的夜色與浪漫燈光之下，全身散發著耀眼的女神光芒。這套極具設計感的斜膊白裙，不僅完美勾勒出她弗爆的好身材，更令她散發出滿滿的仙氣，將優雅與知性的氣質詮釋得淋漓盡致。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"320ca3b3-a4a2-47a2-a270-78101c4f226b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Y0F5NiBtZt1788945011.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"320ca3b3-a4a2-47a2-a270-78101c4f226b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事實上，Jenny每一次的風格突破都能為觀眾帶來全新驚喜，展現出時尚感與精緻度並存的迷人魅力。難怪這次的新造型一出，便引來大批網民留言激讚她「靚出新高度」，紛紛高呼「仙氣爆燈」、「每次都畀人睇到更多嘅可能性」，絕對是成功俘虜了一眾粉絲的心！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T11:20:17.585131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}